WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.250
As new details emerge

2
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:04.033
about what happened to the world's greatest golfer.

3
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:06.610
At the hospital,

4
00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:09.163
he had no recollection of the crash itself.

5
00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:14.550
But there was an issue about if he was under the influence,

6
00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:17.170 line:15%
some type of prescribed medication, for example,

7
00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:18.960 line:15%
or if they did any blood work at the hospital

8
00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.910
that would require a search warrant

9
00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:23.570
to be able to see that information.

10
00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:26.310
E.T. has been with Tiger for his epic highs,

11
00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:30.230
his fall from grace, and stunning comeback in 2019.

12
00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:31.260
I love playing golf,

13
00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:34.240
but now, I'm starting to love just being around people.

14
00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:37.262
We first sat down with Woods in 1996.

15
00:00:37.262 --> 00:00:40.060
So, what are your plans for the 21st birthday?

16
00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:41.890
Ha, no comment.

17
00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:44.060
I've hit the greens with Tiger several times.

18
00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:47.220
We've discussed his wedding to then wife, Elin Nordegren.

19
00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:49.820
The whole idea is for us to be private.

20
00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:52.060
And his desire to have kids.

21
00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:55.210
It's just one of those things that I've never experienced,

22
00:00:55.210 --> 00:00:57.320
but I certainly would like to one day.

23
00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:59.010
Tiger's 12 year old son Charlie

24
00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:00.550
is like his golf twin.

25
00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:02.380
And as for another comeback...

26
00:01:02.380 --> 00:01:04.000
I've always been taught by my parents

27
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.280
never to give any thought to anyone's expectations

28
00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:08.113
but yourselves.

29
00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:10.750
In the wake of the horrific crash

30
00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:12.730
and Tiger's extensive surgeries,

31
00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:16.230
fellow golfer, Rory McIlroy, put it all into perspective.

32
00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:17.670
He's not Superman.

33
00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:19.740
He's a human being at the end of the day.

34
00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:22.000
And you know, he's already been through so much.

35
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:22.833
At their stage,

36
00:01:22.833 --> 00:01:24.130
I think everyone should just be grateful

37
00:01:24.130 --> 00:01:26.030
that he's here, that he's alive,

38
00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:28.170
that his kids haven't lost their dad.

39
00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:31.049
Golf is not even on the map at this point.

40
00:01:31.049 --> 00:01:34.049
(salsa outro music)

